  kingdomName: Ubunifu
  kingdomStory: "\"Ubunifu\" means Creativity and\r\nImagination in Swahili. The
    kingdom \r\nis ruled by an elite council. It began \r\nin the 22nd century after
    a long war \r\nof minds and skills.\r\nThe people are Craftsmen of all sorts
    \r\n& skilled Juju men who developed \r\nhyper neural activity hence ability
    to \r\nread and translate thoughts."
